{"articleNo":"73847","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=73847&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"“대학원 교육의 질과 성과분석 연구” 설문조사 참여 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.01.14","hit":"6838","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 391.24pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #e3f4e3; HEIGHT: 49.61pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">“대학원 교육의 질과 성과분석 연구” 설문조사 참여 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">전국대학원장 협의회에서 “대학원 교육의 질과 성과분석 연구”를 위하여</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;우리 대학원생들의 의견을 수렴하고자 설문조사를 진행 중에 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">대학원생들의 많은 협조를 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 연구의 필요성</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 오늘날 대다수 대학원 졸업자가 취업 또는 창업을 하는 상황에서 대학원 교육의 중요성이 부각 됨</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 대학원 교육의 역할이 차세대 연구인력 육성에만 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">머물기보다 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">전공 분야 지식과 역량을 갖춘 인적자원 양성 기능까지 확대되어야 한다는 사회적 요구도 적지 않은 상황 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 반면 대학원 교육의 질과 성과에 대한 학문적, 정책적 관심은 상대적으로 저조한 현실임</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 본 연구는 미국에서 개발되어 1,400여개 대학에서 널리 활용하고 있음.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 최근 한국에서도 에이스 협의회를 중심으로 각 대학에서 학부교육의 질과 성과를 진단하기 위하여 활용하고 있는 진단 도구를 대학원 교육에 적용하여 우리나라 대학원 교육의 질과 성과를 분석하기 위한 탐색적 연구임 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 설문 방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">가. 설문대상 : 각 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 대학원생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 설문기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 01. 14(월) ~ 01. 25(금)</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 설문방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #08111c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">웹기반 온라인 설문으로 실시</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><a href=\"https://www.surveymonkey.com/s/gradkorea\" target=\"_blank\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffe400\" color=\"#000000\"> </font></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><a href=\"https://www.surveymonkey.com/s/gradkorea\" target=\"_blank\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffe400\" color=\"#000000\">(</font></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><a href=\"https://www.surveymonkey.com/s/gradkorea\" target=\"_blank\"><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffe400\" color=\"#000000\">https://www.surveymonkey.com/s/gradkorea</font></u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><a href=\"https://www.surveymonkey.com/s/gradkorea\" target=\"_blank\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffe400\" color=\"#000000\">)</font></a></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 기타사항 : 연구자료는 설문조사 종료 후 폐기함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">마. 연구관련 문의 : 홍지인 연구원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(E-mail: </span><a href=\"mailto:9199hong@hanmail.net\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">9199hong@hanmail.net</span></u></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</